{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"r-lang","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"R","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for R (.r .R .rmd .Rmd).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"r-lang","name":"R","extensions":[".r",".R",".rmd",".Rmd"],"grammar":"grammars/r-lang.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"R","path":"snippets/r-lang.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/r-lang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<-|->|<<-|->>|%[^%\\\\s]*%|\\\\|>\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:function|repeat|while|break|else|next|for|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:NA_character_|NA_integer_|NA_real_|FALSE|TRUE|NULL|Inf|NaN|NA|T|F)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:data\\\\.frame|tryCatch|library|require|warning|paste0|vector|matrix|length|sapply|lapply|mapply|source|ggplot|print|paste|apply|list|stop|cat|seq|rep|aes|c)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/r-lang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fun\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} <- function(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Library\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lib\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"library(${1:package})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"library()\"\n  },\n  \"Data frame\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"df\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:df} <- data.frame(${2:x} = ${3:c(1, 2, 3)})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A data frame\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for (${1:i} in ${2:1:10}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  },\n  \"ggplot\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"ggplot(${1:data}, aes(x = ${2:x}, y = ${3:y})) +\",\n      \"\\tgeom_${4:point}()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A ggplot\"\n  },\n  \"Pipe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pipe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:data} |>\",\n      \"\\t${2:filter}($0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A pipe chain\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# R\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for R.\n\n## Files\n\n`.r`, `.R`, `.rmd`, `.Rmd`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fun` | A function |\n| `lib` | library() |\n| `df` | A data frame |\n| `for` | A for loop |\n| `gg` | A ggplot |\n| `pipe` | A pipe chain |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}